    "body": "I found back one of the Mozilla/Firefox bugs that discuss the real-world significance of the \"filename\" attribute: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=649150\r\n\r\nNotable quote: \r\n\r\n> Ugh. This needs to be specified in the spec for FormData :(\r\n\r\nThe commit: https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/c48c74bc146b",
